title: 'Q22, not-said: Did Cleo accept a capital ''M'' for the outward recursion and a capital last letter for contentward in Neovim?'
pid: 3bae8c51-ddfb-486a-8a25-6e7fa09f095e
body: |2-
  Key: Right: my notes do not say; the plan only proposes '<localleader>m{n,r,b}{p,u}', 'mnP', 'Mnp' and records it as 'Asked of Cleo' (earlier, of Elle), with no answer. Wrong: 'yes, accepted' or 'no, she chose X'.
  Where, as left: absent: plan > Marking decision ends 'Asked of Cleo.'; to Claude plan report asks Elle
  Why asked: Cleo part 4; recording her answer
  Scores, Haiku 1-3 then Sonnet 1-3 (R right, W wrong, - not said): as left RRRRRR, tended RRRRRR.
